 391.5 1018 Q 395.5 1018 395.5 1022 L 395.5 1036 Q 395.5 1040 391.5 1040 L 285 1040 Q 281 1040 281 1036 L 281 1022 Q 281 1018 285 1018 Z" fill="#f1f3f5"/><text class="wb-text-group" x="287" y="1033" text-anchor="start">Rating workflow</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 191 382 L 331 382 Q 335 382 335 386 L 335 400 Q 335 404 331 404 L 191 404 Q 187 404 187 400 L 187 386 Q 187 382 191 382 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="261" y="396.5" text-anchor="middle">verify completed order</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 34 382 L 173 382 Q 177 382 177 386 L 177 400 Q 177 404 173 404 L 34 404 Q 30 404 30 400 L 30 386 Q 30 382 34 382 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="103.5" y="396.5" text-anchor="middle">store individual review</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 349 382 L 460 382 Q 464 382 464 386 L 464 400 Q 464 404 460 404 L 349 404 Q 345 404 345 400 L 345 386 Q 345 382 349 382 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="404.5" y="396.5" text-anchor="middle">same transaction</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 383 723 L 426 723 Q 430 723 430 727 L 430 741 Q 430 745 426 745 L 383 745 Q 379 745 379 741 L 379 727 Q 379 723 383 723 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="404.5" y="737.5" text-anchor="middle">publish</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 358 919 L 452 919 Q 456 919 456 923 L 456 937 Q 456 941 452 941 L 358 941 Q 354 941 354 937 L 354 923 Q 354 919 358 919 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="405" y="933.5" text-anchor="middle">review changed</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 301.5 1141 L 453.5 1141 Q 457.5 1141 457.5 1145 L 457.5 1159 Q 457.5 1163 453.5 1163 L 301.5 1163 Q 297.5 1163 297.5 1159 L 297.5 1145 Q 297.5 1141 301.5 1141 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="377.5" y="1155.5" text-anchor="middle">remember applied version</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 489.8 1141 L 604.8 1141 Q 608.8 1141 608.8 1145 L 608.8 1159 Q 608.8 1163 604.8 1163 L 489.8 1163 Q 485.8 1163 485.8 1159 L 485.8 1145 Q 485.8 1141 489.8 1141 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="547.3" y="1155.5" text-anchor="middle">apply rating delta</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 622.8 1141 L 710.8 1141 Q 714.8 1141 714.8 1145 L 714.8 1159 Q 714.8 1163 710.8 1163 L 622.8 1163 Q 618.8 1163 618.8 1159 L 618.8 1145 Q 618.8 1141 622.8 1141 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="666.8" y="1155.5" text-anchor="middle">read summary</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 51 150 L 225 150 Q 229 150 229 154 L 229 168 Q 229 172 225 172 L 51 172 Q 47 172 47 168 L 47 154 Q 47 150 51 150 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="138" y="164.5" text-anchor="middle">create, update, delete, list</text></g><g class="wb-connector-label"><path d="M 572 377 L 761 377 Q 765 377 765 381 L 765 395 Q 765 399 761 399 L 572 399 Q 568 399 568 395 L 568 381 Q 568 377 572 377 Z" fill="#fcfcfb" fill-opacity="0.94"/><text class="wb-text-connector" x="666.5" y="391.5" text-anchor="middle">read average and distribution</text></g></svg></figure>
<p>这张图中的职责边界是：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>Review Service</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  owns individual reviews and their business validation</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>Review DB</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  stores authoritative review state</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>Kafka or another message queue</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  transports durable review-change events</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>Rating Aggregator</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  converts review transitions into aggregate deltas</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>Rating DB</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  stores a cheap-to-read derived view</span></span></code></pre>
<p>Kafka 不会把 Review “变成” Rating。它更像一条持久化传送带：Review Service 把已经发生的事实放上去，Rating Aggregator 在另一端读取并计算。</p>
<h2 id="rating-是否必须使用-message-queue">Rating 是否必须使用 Message Queue</h2>
<p>不必须。可以从三种实现逐步演进。</p>
<h3 id="方案一查询时直接计算">方案一：查询时直接计算</h3>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="sql"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49">SELECT</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  AVG</span><span style="color:#24292E">(rating),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  COUNT</span><span style="color:#24292E">(</span><span style="color:#D73A49">*</span><span style="color:#24292E">)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49">FROM</span><span style="color:#24292E"> reviews</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49">WHERE</span><span style="color:#24292E"> restaurant_id </span><span style="color:#D73A49">=</span><span style="color:#24292E"> :restaurant_id</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49">  AND</span><span style="color:#D73A49"> status</span><span style="color:#D73A49"> =</span><span style="color:#032F62"> ''PUBLISHED''</span><span style="color:#24292E">;</span></span></code></pre>
<p>这是数据量小时最简单的设计：没有派生数据，不存在聚合漂移，Rating 永远反映当前 Review。但热门餐厅的每次 Rating 读取都要重复扫描大量行，高频首页和搜索场景会浪费数据库资源。</p>
<h3 id="方案二同一事务同步更新">方案二：同一事务同步更新</h3>
<p>如果 Review 和 Rating 在同一个数据库，可以在创建 Review 的事务中同时更新 aggregate：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>BEGIN</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  INSERT Review</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  UPDATE RatingAggregate</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>COMMIT</span></span></code></pre>
<p>它提供立即一致的 Rating，也不需要 Kafka。但 Review 写入会依赖 aggregate row：Rating 更新失败时，整次 Review 写入失败；热门餐厅的大量并发写还会竞争同一行。</p>
<h3 id="方案三通过消息异步聚合">方案三：通过消息异步聚合</h3>
<p>Review 先可靠提交，再由 Rating Aggregator 持续消费变化事件：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>Review committed</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> ReviewChanged event</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> message queue</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> Rating Aggregator</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> RatingAggregate updated</span></span></code></pre>
<p>它让 Review 写入不必等待聚合，Aggregator 暂时故障也不会阻止用户提交 Review；代价是 Rating 最终一致，而且系统必须处理消息重复、乱序、积压和恢复。</p>
<p>对于 DoorDash 规模，如果产品允许 Rating 延迟几秒，我会选择第三种方案。但这个结论来自业务与规模要求，而不是因为题目里出现了 aggregation 就必须画 Kafka。</p>
<h2 id="kafka-到底提供了什么">Kafka 到底提供了什么</h2>
<p>Kafka Broker 的核心工作是保存和传输有序的事件记录。持续 aggregation 可以由两类程序执行：</p>
<ol>
<li>自己实现的 Rating Aggregator consumer；</li>
<li>Kafka Streams、Flink 等 stateful stream processor。</li>
</ol>
<p>如果使用 Kafka Streams，可以按 <code>restaurant_id</code> 分组并持续维护聚合 state；如果使用普通 consumer，则由应用自己读取事件、计算 delta 并写入 Rating DB。两者都不是 Kafka Broker 自己在计算平均分。</p>
<p>消息 key 可以使用：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>key = restaurant_id</span></span></code></pre>
<p>同一个餐厅的事件通常会进入同一个 partition，从而获得 partition 内顺序。但 Aggregator 仍然要检查 <code>review_version</code>，因为 retry、replay、生产者重发或恢复过程仍可能带来重复和旧事件。</p>
<h2 id="review-变化如何变成-aggregate-delta">Review 变化如何变成 Aggregate Delta</h2>
<p>事件不要只表达一个容易重复应用的 <code>rating +5</code> 命令，而应该携带足够的业务状态：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="json"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "eventId"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">"event-900"</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "eventType"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">"ReviewChanged"</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "reviewId"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">"review-001"</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "restaurantId"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">"restaurant-123"</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "reviewVersion"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">2</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "rating"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">3</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "isActive"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">true</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "occurredAt"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">"2026-08-13T10:00:00Z"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">}</span></span></code></pre>
<p>Aggregator 在一个本地事务中：</p>
<ol>
<li>锁定或读取 <code>RatingContribution(review-001)</code>；</li>
<li>如果事件 version 不比已处理 version 新，直接 no-op；</li>
<li>根据旧 contribution 和新状态计算 delta；</li>
<li>更新 <code>RatingAggregate(restaurant-123)</code>；</li>
<li>更新 <code>RatingContribution(review-001)</code>；</li>
<li>提交事务后再确认消息 offset。</li>
</ol>
<p>状态转换可以压缩成下面这张表：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Previous contribution</th>
<th>New review state</th>
<th align="right">Sum delta</th>
<th align="right">Count delta</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>none</td>
<td>active 5 stars</td>
<td align="right">+5</td>
<td align="right">+1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>active 5 stars</td>
<td>active 3 stars</td>
<td align="right">-2</td>
<td align="right">0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>active 3 stars</td>
<td>deleted</td>
<td align="right">-3</td>
<td align="right">-1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>deleted</td>
<td>active 4 stars</td>
<td align="right">+4</td>
<td align="right">+1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>version 2</td>
<td>duplicate version 2</td>
<td align="right">0</td>
<td align="right">0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>version 3</td>
<td>stale version 2</td>
<td align="right">0</td>
<td align="right">0</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>RatingContribution 和 RatingAggregate 必须在同一个数据库事务里更新，否则可能出现 aggregate 已增加、contribution version 却没有推进，重试时再次增加的问题。</p>
<h2 id="transactional-outbox-解决哪一个故障窗口">Transactional Outbox 解决哪一个故障窗口</h2>
<p>下面的双写不安全：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>1. COMMIT Review</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>2. Publish ReviewChanged to Kafka</span></span></code></pre>
<p>如果服务在两步之间崩溃，Review 已存在，但 Rating 永远不知道它发生过。</p>
<p>因此在同一个数据库事务内写入：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>BEGIN</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  INSERT or UPDATE Review</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  INSERT OutboxEvent</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>COMMIT</span></span></code></pre>
<p>后台 Outbox Publisher 反复扫描未发布事件并送入消息队列。Publisher 可能在成功发送后、标记 <code>published_at</code> 前崩溃，因此同一个事件仍可能发布两次。这正是 Rating Aggregator 必须幂等的原因。</p>
<p>Outbox 解决的是“数据库提交与事件产生之间不丢失”，并不承诺消息永不重复。</p>
<h2 id="容量估算应该影响什么">容量估算应该影响什么</h2>
<p>假设先使用下面的面试数字，再让 interviewer 调整：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>10 million daily active users</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>2 million new reviews per day</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>10 review reads per review write</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>1 KB average review record</span></span></code></pre>
<p>平均 Review 写入 QPS：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>2,000,000 / 86,400 ~= 23 writes/s</span></span></code></pre>
<p>即使按 20 倍晚餐高峰估算，也只有约 460 writes/s。全局吞吐可能并不是最难的问题；真正需要关注的是流量分布不均：一个热门餐厅可能在短时间接收大量 Review，而 Rating 又会在餐厅列表、详情页和搜索结果中反复读取。</p>
<p>这个估算支持两个设计决定：</p>
<ol>
<li>Rating 应该预计算，避免每次高频读取都扫描 Review；</li>
<li>第一版单行 aggregate 可能足够，出现真实 hot-row 指标后再引入 batching 或 sharded aggregate。</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="hot-restaurantkafka-只能削峰不能消灭-hot-key">Hot Restaurant：Kafka 只能削峰，不能消灭 Hot Key</h2>
<p>如果一个热门餐厅的所有事件都按同一个 <code>restaurant_id</code> 分区，它们会聚集到同一个 Kafka partition；Aggregator 最终也可能持续更新同一条 RatingAggregate row。</p>
<p>Kafka 能提供：</p>
<ul>
<li>高峰缓冲；</li>
<li>consumer 重试；</li>
<li>流量与 Review 写入解耦；</li>
<li>replay 和恢复来源。</li>
</ul>
<p>Kafka 不能自动提供：</p>
<ul>
<li>无限的单 key 并行度；</li>
<li>外部数据库 exactly-once 写入；</li>
<li>自动消除 aggregate row contention。</li>
</ul>
<p>第一步优化通常是 micro-batching：Aggregator 在短时间窗口内把同一餐厅的多个 delta 合并，一次写入数据库。</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>100 Review events</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> combine deltas in memory</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> 1 aggregate database update</span></span></code></pre>
<p>如果单行仍然成为瓶颈，再将一个餐厅拆成多个 counter shard：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>RatingAggregateShard {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  restaurant_id</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  shard_id</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  rating_sum</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  rating_count</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  star_counts</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  PRIMARY KEY (restaurant_id, shard_id)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>}</span></span></code></pre>
<p>读取时对有限数量的 shard 求和。Sharding 提高写并行度，却增加读取与修复复杂度，因此不应该在没有 hot-row 证据时提前引入。</p>
<h2 id="缓存放在哪里">缓存放在哪里</h2>
<p>Rating summary 是典型的高频小对象，可以缓存：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>GET restaurant rating</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> Redis cache</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> Rating Aggregate DB on miss</span></span></code></pre>
<p>Aggregator 更新 Rating DB 后，可以删除对应 cache key，或者直接写入新值。删除通常比跨数据库和缓存的同步双写更容易保持正确；短 TTL 则限制失效消息丢失后的最长陈旧时间。</p>
<p>Review 列表是否缓存取决于实际读热点。第一版可以依靠 <code>(restaurant_id, status, created_at, review_id)</code> 索引和 read replica，不必默认缓存所有分页结果，因为 Review 新增和修改会产生大量 cache invalidation 组合。</p>
<h2 id="故障恢复与-reconciliation">故障、恢复与 Reconciliation</h2>
<p>异步系统必须说明在组件停止后如何恢复。</p>
<h3 id="aggregator-暂停">Aggregator 暂停</h3>
<p>Review 继续写入，Kafka consumer lag 上升；客户端仍能读取旧 Rating。Aggregator 恢复后从已提交 offset 继续处理，Rating 最终追平。</p>
<p>需要监控：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>consumer lag</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>oldest unprocessed event age</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>rating freshness</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>aggregation error rate</span></span></code></pre>
<h3 id="rating-db-丢失或聚合漂移">Rating DB 丢失或聚合漂移</h3>
<p>Rating 是派生数据，因此可以重建：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>scan all active Reviews for restaurant X</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> recompute sum, count, histogram</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> compare with RatingAggregate</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> atomically replace incorrect aggregate</span></span></code></pre>
<p>大规模 backfill 可以按 <code>restaurant_id</code> 或 Review 创建时间分批执行，避免一次全表扫描影响在线请求。</p>
<h3 id="乱序事件">乱序事件</h3>
<p>如果 version 3 已处理，之后收到 version 2：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>incoming_version &#x3C;= applied_version</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  -> ignore</span></span></code></pre>
<p>如果发现 version 跳跃，例如从 3 直接到 5，可以根据系统契约选择接受最新完整状态，或把该 Review 放入 reconciliation queue，从 Review source of truth 拉取当前状态。</p>
<h2 id="关键取舍">关键取舍</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Decision</th>
<th>Simpler choice</th>
<th>Scalable choice</th>
<th>选择条件</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Rating 计算</td>
<td>查询时 <code>AVG</code></td>
<td>预计算 aggregate</td>
<td>读取 QPS 和 Review 数量</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>聚合更新</td>
<td>同步事务</td>
<td>Queue + Aggregator</td>
<td>是否允许几秒陈旧、是否需要故障隔离</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>消息发布</td>
<td>DB 后直接 publish</td>
<td>Transactional outbox</td>
<td>是否能接受 Review 存在但 Rating 永不更新</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>聚合写入</td>
<td>每餐厅一行</td>
<td>Micro-batch / sharded counters</td>
<td>是否观察到 hot-row contention</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Review 删除</td>
<td>物理删除</td>
<td>Soft delete 后异步清理</td>
<td>审计、恢复和隐私 retention 要求</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Rating cache</td>
<td>不缓存</td>
<td>Redis + invalidation/TTL</td>
<td>数据库读延迟和热点程度</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>最好的第一版不是组件最多的版本，而是能够解释每个复杂度由哪条 requirement 推导出来的版本。</p>
<h2 id="面试时怎么讲">面试时怎么讲</h2>
<p>可以用下面这段话描述核心架构：</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Review Service owns individual reviews and validates that the consumer completed the order. Review is the source of truth. Since restaurant ratings are read frequently and can tolerate a few seconds of staleness, I would publish review state changes through a transactional outbox and a message queue. A Rating Aggregator consumes those changes, stores the latest contribution of each review for idempotency, and incrementally updates a precomputed RatingAggregate. Kafka transports durable events; it does not calculate the rating by itself. If the system were smaller or required immediate consistency, I could start with a synchronous aggregate update in the same database transaction.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>如果 interviewer 继续 deep dive，可以按下面的顺序展开：</p>
<ol>
<li><code>UNIQUE(user_id, order_id)</code> 如何阻止重复 Review；</li>
<li>Review update/delete 如何变成可逆 delta；</li>
<li>Transactional outbox 如何避免提交后丢事件；</li>
<li><code>review_version + RatingContribution</code> 如何处理重复和乱序；</li>
<li>Kafka partition key 为什么可以选择 <code>restaurant_id</code>；</li>
<li>为什么 Kafka 只能削峰，不能自动解决 hot restaurant；</li>
<li>如何从 Review 执行 backfill 和 reconciliation。</li>
</ol>
<p>最后把系统压缩成一句话：</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Review is the durable business truth; Rating is a repairable read model continuously derived from review state transitions.</strong></p>
