<span class="line"><span>  transaction_id UNIQUE,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  account_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  event_time,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  decision_time,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  decision,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  risk_score,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  reason_codes,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  ruleset_version,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  model_version,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  feature_snapshot_ref,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  latency_ms</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>FraudLabel(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  label_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  transaction_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  label,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  source,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  source_version,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  effective_time,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  received_time,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  confidence</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>RuleSet(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  ruleset_version,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  definition_uri,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  state,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  approved_by,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  activated_at</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span></code></pre>
<p>不要更新旧 Decision 来反映新 label。Decision 表示“当时系统做了什么”；Label 表示“后来知道了什么”。两者通过 transaction ID 连接。</p>
<p>同一交易可能先由人工标成可疑，后来 chargeback 确认。Label 应保留事件历史和来源，训练数据生成时再按政策选择最终可信标签。</p>
<h2 id="第二版把-velocity-特征移出同步数据库查询">第二版：把 velocity 特征移出同步数据库查询</h2>
<p>每笔交易都用 SQL 扫“过去五分钟交易”，在高峰会成为瓶颈。更合理的做法是事件流按 <code>account_id</code> 或 <code>card_id</code> 分区，持续维护窗口状态：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>attempt_count_5m</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>decline_count_1h</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>distinct_device_count_24h</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>amount_sum_24h</span></span></code></pre>
<p>Streaming job 把当前值写入低延迟 feature store，并把历史写入离线存储。</p>
<figure class="whiteboard-diagram" data-diagram-type="flowchart" style="--wb-natural-width: 1795px"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="-8 -8 1795 383" width="1795" height="383" role="img" aria-labelledby="wb-umwysk-0-title wb-umwysk-0-desc"><title id="wb-umwysk-0-title">Diagram: Payment gateway, Decision API, Rules engine, Online feature store, Model serving, …</title><desc id="wb-umwysk-0-desc">Payment gateway → Decision API; Decision API → Rules engine; Decision API → Online feature store; Decision API → Model serving; Rules engine → Decision policy; Model serving → Decision policy; Decision policy → Payment gateway; Decision API → Transaction event stream; Transaction event stream → Streaming features; Streaming features → Online feature store; Transaction event stream → Offline history; Labels + review → Offline history; Offline history → Training pipeline; Training pipeline → Model registry; Model registry → Model serving</desc><g class="wb-connector"><path d="M174.1 309.6 C177.4 309.6, 179.9 309, 185.9 309.9 M172.4 309.6 C176.3 310.5, 180.6 310.4, 184.8 309.9 M185 310 C192.5 309.8, 195.9 304.2, 196 296.5 M183.8 311.3 C190.9 311, 196.8 304.6, 196 296.1 M197.7 299.2 C194.8 234.5, 195.8 170.9, 195.4 122.8 M197.2 298.1 C197 248.3, 196.9 198.9, 197.6 120.6 M197 121 C195.7 111.6, 200.9 109.7, 207.6 110.8 M195.6 122.3 C194.9 113, 199 108.3, 210.1 109.2 M208.7 110.5 C219.1 108.3, 229 108.4, 236.2 108 M208.9 109.2 C217.8 109.6, 228.3 108.5, 237.3 109.5" fill="none" stroke="#1e1e1e" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M226.5 103.1 C229 104.6, 231.4 106.1, 236.6 108.4 M226 103.9 C230 105.7, 233.1 107.1, 237 108.8 M236.8 108.7 C234.6 111.1, 231.6 111.7, 226.8 114 M236.9 109.3 C234.4 110.3, 232.7 111.3, 225.9 113.9" fill="none" stroke="#1e1e1e" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g class="wb-connector"><path d="M361.6 88.2 C366 89.1, 370.7 87.8, 374.7 89 M362.3 88.7 C364.7 87.6, 367.1