- [Consistent Hashing and Random Trees](https://www.cs.princeton.edu/courses/archive/fall09/cos518/papers/chash.pdf)
- [The Log-Structured Merge-Tree](https://www.cs.umb.edu/~poneil/lsmtree.pdf)
