<p>Alice 关注 Bob 和 Carol。两人最近发了：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>10:05 Bob   post-8</span></span>
