<p>Delivery 状态机：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>PENDING -> SENDING -> ACCEPTED -> DELIVERED</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                \-> RETRY_WAIT -> SENDING</span></span>
