<h2 id="template变量-schema-比字符串替换重要">Template：变量 Schema 比字符串替换重要</h2>
<p>模板定义：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="yaml"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#22863A">name</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">order-shipped</span></span>
