- [ ] Order book 数据结构设计
- [ ] 撮合算法（price-time priority）
- [ ] 单线程 in-memory 引擎 + event sourcing
- [ ] Sharding by symbol
- [ ] Market data dissemination（L1 / L2 / time-and-sales）
- [ ] Durability / fault tolerance / replay
