M834 80h400000v40h-400000z"></path></svg></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1133em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时碰撞就开始明显，而不是等空间用满。8 位 Base62 空间约 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.18</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2.18 \times 10^{14}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">2.18</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.8141em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8141em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；创建数达到千万级时仍需认真处理碰撞，但重试成本可控。</p>
<p>自定义 alias 也走同一唯一约束。<code>news</code>、<code>admin</code> 等保留字提前拒绝，Unicode 需规范化，避免视觉相同但字节不同的 alias。</p>
<h2 id="数据模型管理状态与解析数据分开考虑">数据模型：管理状态与解析数据分开考虑</h2>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>ShortLink(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  link_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  code UNIQUE,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  owner_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  long_url,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  state,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  expires_at,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  version,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  created_at,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  updated_at</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>LinkAuditEvent(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  link_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  sequence,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  event_type,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  actor_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  old_value_hash,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  new_value_hash,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  created_at</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>ClickEvent(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  event_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  link_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  event_time,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  referrer,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  coarse_geo,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  user_agent_class</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span></code></pre>
<p><code>ShortLink</code> 是 redirect 的事实来源。<code>LinkAuditEvent</code> 支持调查 target 修改和封禁。<code>ClickEvent</code> 是大吞吐 append-only 流，不与 ShortLink 放在同一个 OLTP 事务里。</p>
<p>若允许修改 target，使用 <code>version</code> 做 optimistic concurrency：Owner 基于 version 4 更新时，不能覆盖管理员刚在 version 5 做的封禁。</p>
<h2 id="容量估算先算-code-空间再算读写比和存储">容量估算：先算 code 空间，再算读写比和存储</h2>
<p>假设每天创建 1 亿条链接，保留 5 年：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>100M × 365 × 5 = 182.5B links</span></span></code></pre>
<p>这个规模已超过 7 位 Base62 空间的安全使用范围，需要更长 code 或更大字符集。8 位有约 218T 组合，仍要监控占用与碰撞。</p>
<p>若每行 metadata 平均 500 bytes：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>182.5B × 500B ≈ 91TB raw data</span></span></code></pre>
<p>加索引、replica 和备份会到数百 TB，必须按 code hash 分片。</p>
<p>假设每个链接平均被访问 10 次，长期读写比约 10:1；实际分布极度倾斜，一个名人短链可能瞬间产生百万 QPS。因此容量不能只按平均 redirect QPS，还要设计热点缓存和 CDN。</p>
<h2 id="加缓存先处理正缓存再小心负缓存">加缓存：先处理正缓存，再小心负缓存</h2>
<p>Resolve 路径变成：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>code -> local cache -> distributed cache -> database</span></span></code></pre>
<p>Cache value 包含 <code>long_url</code>、state、expiry 和 version。TTL 可以比链接过期短，并取：</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code><span class="line"><span>min(normal_cache_ttl, link_expires_at - now)</span></span></code></pre>
<p>不存在的随机 code 会形成数据库攻击。可以短暂 negative cache，例如 30 秒，但封禁或刚创建的 code 需要正确 invalidation。Negative TTL 不能太长，否则创建一个之前被探测过的 alias 后，用户仍看到 404。</p>
<p>热点链接在 local cache 和 CDN edge 即可吸收大量请求。缓存单个 code 不需要把所有链接都放进内存；让访问分布决定 residency。</p>
<h2 id="高层架构重定向热路径越短越好">高层架构：重定向热路径越短越好</h2>
<figure class="whiteboard-diagram" data-diagram-type="flowchart" style="--wb-natural-width: 1540px"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="-8 -8 1540 488" width="1540" height="488" role="img" aria-labelledby="wb-1glq3zh-0-title wb-1glq3zh-0-desc"><title id="wb-1glq3zh-0-title">Diagram: Browser, CDN / edge, Redirect service, Local cache, Distributed cache, …</title><desc id="wb-1glq3zh-0-desc">Browser → CDN / edge; CDN / edge → Redirect service; Redirect service → Local cache; Redirect service → Distributed cache; Redirect service → Sharded link store; Redirect service → Click event stream; Owner → Link management API; Link management API → Sharded link store; Link management API → Cache invalidation; Cache invalidation → Distributed cache; Cache invalidation → CDN / edge; Click event stream → Analytics pipeline</desc><g class="wb-connector"><path d="M586.6 279.7 C607.4 277.1, 627.9 279.1, 651.2 277.1 M587.2 277.1 C602.8 278.1, 618.9 278.5, 650.1 278.5" fill="none" stroke="#1e1e1e" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M639.6 272.9 C644.2 273.7, 647.6 276.5, 651.5 278.5 M640.4 272.8 C643.5 274.1, 646.3 275.5, 650.8 278.1 M650.9 278.2 C648.7 278.8, 645.9 280.3, 640.4 284 M651 278.2 C648.8 279, 646.7 280, 640.3 283.2" fill="none" stroke="#1e1e1e" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g class="wb-connector"><path d="M818.1 292.6 C841.1 294.8, 861.5 291.8, 882.4 294.7 M816.5 294.8 C839.9 294.7, 863 295, 880.4 293.4" fill="none" stroke="#1e1e1e" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M870.2 289.3 C873.8 290.6, 878.2 291.8, 880.5 293.7 M870.2 288.7 C874 290.8, 878.8 292.8, 880.9 293.7 M881 293.7 C878 295, 875.5 296.7, 869.8 300 M881.1 294 C877.6 295.7, 873.9 297.7, 870.2 299.1" fill="none" stroke="#1e1e1e" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g class="wb-connector"><path d="M1030.6 286.5 C1040.2 286.3, 1048.6 286.3, 1052.